Adds the Stellux nvkmd's pdev over /dev/gpuN, an enumeration hook that hands
NVK's physical device creation a pdev for each NVIDIA GPU, and a
chipset-to-name table with the names nouveau's nvkmd reads from its kernel.
A chip missing from the table gets the name NV<chipset in hex>.

